# Tribunal "An Assassination Attempt": King Helseth, led from "bit of
# misinformation" through "threat to our monarchy", "see us dead" and "plot",
# sends the player to his informant ("this matter": 10). Bakh gro-Sham in the Winged Guar, at
# disposition 60, answers the code phrase ("uncle's farm": 40) and, after "what
# you should know", names the Queen Mother as the target ("disturbing
# information": 50). Helseth, told of it ("plot"), orders the player to guard
# her ("protect Barenziah": 80). Waiting within 192 of the
# marker in Barenziah's Chambers until nightfall on a later day logs 85
# (barAssScript) and brings the three assassins (helsAssScript); their deaths
# log 90, and Helseth gives his collar (100).
# The player waits an hour at a time on the spot, as the Wait key does. Bribes,
# repeated until they land, raise Bakh. The fight is `defend`'s. Ref FormIDs
# carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Drafted, not yet run.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_bamz --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_assassins
run
player->PositionCell 2 53 -92 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetDistance player < 400
talk King Hlaalu Helseth
ask bit of misinformation
ask threat to our monarchy
ask see us dead
ask plot
ask this matter
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Assassins == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell -480 -74 -357 0 "Mournhold, The Winged Guar"
until 600 "bakh gro-sham"->GetDistance player < 400
talk bakh gro-sham
persuade bribe100 until "bakh gro-sham"->GetDisposition >= 60
ask uncle's farm
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Assassins == 40
ask what you should know
ask disturbing information
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Assassins == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 2 53 -92 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetDistance player < 400
talk King Hlaalu Helseth
ask plot
ask protect Barenziah
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Assassins == 80
bye
run
player->PositionCell 372 -300 -91 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace: Barenziah's Chambers"
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Royal Palace: Barenziah's Chambers" == 1
wait 300
rest 48 - GetJournalIndex TR_Assassins >= 85
defend
until 1800 GetJournalIndex TR_Assassins == 90
run
player->PositionCell 2 53 -92 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetDistance player < 400
talk King Hlaalu Helseth
ask protect Barenziah
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Assassins == 100
bye
end
